6" width="420" height="26"><Container width="420" height="26" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="16" color="#E9EEF1" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">再加 15.00 元（满 45 减 14）</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="492" top="1164" width="150" height="30"><Container width="150" height="30" alignment="CENTER_RIGHT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#F2A73B" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC">32.22</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="662" top="1166" width="340" height="26"><Container width="340" height="26" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="14" color="#7C8A93" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">多减 6.00 元，多花 9.00 元</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="62" top="1206" width="150" height="46"><Container width="150" height="46" color="#131B20" borderRadius="23.0" border="1 SOLID #F0785F" alignment="CENTER"><Text color="#F0785F" fontSize="17" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" textAlign="CENTER">结论：不值</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="232" top="1206" width="786" height="26"><Container width="786" height="26" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#B6C4CC" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">多花 15.00 元只为了多减 6.00 元，净多支出 9.00 元。</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="232" top="1232" width="786" height="26"><Container width="786" height="26" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#B6C4CC" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">除非那 15.00 元的东西你本来就要吃；否则凑单省下的不是钱，是冰箱。</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="40" top="1290" width="1000" height="103"><Container width="1000" height="103" color="#131B20" borderRadius="14" border="1 SOLID #2B3941"/></Positioned><Positioned left="60" top="1302" width="960" height="25"><Container width="960" height="25" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="14" color="#7C8A93" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">口径：配送费＝起步 3.00 元 + 超出免费里程 0.6 km × 1.20 元/km；满减与优惠券可叠加，按店内标示顺序计算。</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="60" top="1327" width="960" height="25"><Container width="960" height="25" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="14" color="#7C8A93" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">凑单那一档按「加购件不再产生包装费、配送费不变」计，这是最省算法；真实加购通常还要加包装费，只会更不值。</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="60" top="1352" width="960" height="25"><Container width="960" height="25" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="14" color="#7C8A93" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">本卡不含：会员红包、时段折扣、准时宝与骑手小费、发票与税。店铺、菜品、价格、里程均为虚构演示值，不是任何平台报价。</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="40" top="1401" width="1000" height="21"><Container width="1000" height="21" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="12" color="#7C8A93" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">数据：tmp/20261008T1615Z-run01/B06/research/demo.json（b06data.py，seed=20261011）｜浮动条比例尺 16 px = 1 元；条长严格等比，未做最小宽度修饰。</Text></Container></Positioned></Stack></Container></Snapshot>